= The Pragmatic section walks out

After months of voicing out their disagreements, lately so even publicly, the Pragmatics amongst the party have resigned en masse. The faction representing cool headed-ness and measurable results seems to have given up on us and the direction taken by ERC. 

- @post_event: We must carry on...
